 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Ahithophel the Gilonite left his home",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To counsel the king who wore the crown",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His words were weighed like the word of God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Esteemed by both David and Absalom",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.88,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "When the rebellion grew strong and deep",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.97,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He joined the side of the rebellious heir",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "David fled on foot with his people",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Praying for the Lord to break the scheme",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Turn Ahithophel's counsel into folly",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Let the good advice be frustrated",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For the Lord has ordained the outcome",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And the plans of the wicked are scattered",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He advised to take the concubines",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To show the break was absolute and true",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then to strike by night with twelve thousand men",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To catch the weary king in his flight",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Turn Ahithophel's counsel into folly",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Let the good advice be frustrated",
   "heard": 6,
